# Milestone 28: box appearance (reference/common/box.md). Corner radius, Border color per side, Background with a
# gradient and colors with opacity only change the painting: the dump checks that they do not move any box, and the
# PNGs (with the debug outlines) are checked by eye. Page of 300 × 300 with margins of 20: page area of
# 260 × 260 from (20, 20). Each row is a Stack of 260 × 50 with gaps of 10 and a margin of 10 below: y = 20, 80, 140
# and 200; the last block starts at 200 + 50 + 10 = 260.
#   row1: round (100 × 50, Corner radius 12, border of 3 in another color), circle (50 × 50, Corner radius 50%: a circle) and
#         corners (Corner radius 0 20 0 20: only two corners, diagonally opposite). x = 20, 130 and 190.
#   row2: sides (four border colors, diagonal joins), sidesRound (two colors and Corner radius 20) and stripe
#         (Border 0 0 0 4: the stripe of a notice). x = 20, 130 and 190.
#   row3: gradient (linear with three colors at 90°: from left to right) and base with fade on top (linear at 180°
#         from a transparent to an opaque blue: from top to bottom, with opacity). x = 20 and 130.
#   row4: photo (Image with Corner radius 50%: cropped to a circle) and framed (Corner radius 10 and border of 2: the image is clipped
#         with the radius of the content box, 8). x = 20 and 80.
#   split: 100 × 100 with Corner radius 12 on the split box: on page 1 only 280 − 260 = 20 fit and on page 2 the remaining
#          80; with Edges: open, the first part has only the top corners and the second only the bottom ones.
Result:
	Page: 1
		Fragment: row1
			Rect: 20 20 260 50
			Fragment: round
				Rect: 20 20 100 50
			Fragment: circle
				Rect: 130 20 50 50
			Fragment: corners
				Rect: 190 20 50 50
		Fragment: row2
			Rect: 20 80 260 50
			Fragment: sides
				Rect: 20 80 100 50
			Fragment: sidesRound
				Rect: 130 80 50 50
			Fragment: stripe
				Rect: 190 80 50 50
		Fragment: row3
			Rect: 20 140 260 50
			Fragment: gradient
				Rect: 20 140 100 50
			Fragment: base
				Rect: 130 140 100 50
				Fragment: fade
					Rect: 130 140 100 50
		Fragment: row4
			Rect: 20 200 260 50
			Fragment: photo
				Rect: 20 200 50 50
			Fragment: framed
				Rect: 80 200 100 50
		Fragment: split
			Rect: 20 260 100 20
	Page: 2
